ull, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20530, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01U8FQTUtpAdmP1h1vBjtteZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20530, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011EkZEocst2TJ6Gqkj75rhp", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20830, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011EkZEocst2TJ6Gqkj75rhp", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20830, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011EkZEocst2TJ6Gqkj75rhp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25348, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015ZF6vVPGnoabaZNx1dWr4L", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with error rate ~18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging prior to promotion. Rolled back all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release healthy in production. First rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, leaving regions mixed); a retry completed successfully. Post-rollback: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure, the orchestrator partial-failure error, and why an unhealthy staging RC was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55948, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015ZF6vVPGnoabaZNx1dWr4L", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55948, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015ZF6vVPGnoabaZNx1dWr4L", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57670, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HzTU1rbDFnMBPjUunPhqC2", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57970, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HzTU1rbDFnMBPjUunPhqC2", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57970, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HzTU1rbDFnMBPjUunPhqC2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63012, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **What went wrong:** the latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Problem along the way:** the first rollback stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1. Repeating a rollback to the same version is safe, so I retried once and it finished in every region.\n- **Now:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and the incident had been created, so I didn't send it a second time. It's open, and opening it pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the failed first attempt) and these follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 is failing.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production: its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was already failing health checks in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WepvvVJ3bbEMYAq6PEoUKF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PMKVKTqs6tsy8CYJ3ScsCo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BRh3pHkQS8DK3axxjVapCS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XJxckodeMR1oLnsfvnqmxz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollback: us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XAnTirTVAsvb6bCaRsjrcp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01U8FQTUtpAdmP1h1vBjtteZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011EkZEocst2TJ6Gqkj75rhp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015ZF6vVPGnoabaZNx1dWr4L", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with error rate ~18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging prior to promotion. Rolled back all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release healthy in production. First rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, leaving regions mixed); a retry completed successfully. Post-rollback: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure, the orchestrator partial-failure error, and why an unhealthy staging RC was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01HzTU1rbDFnMBPjUunPhqC2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **What went wrong:** the latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Problem along the way:** the first rollback stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1. Repeating a rollback to the same version is safe, so I retried once and it finished in every region.\n- **Now:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and the incident had been created, so I didn't send it a second time. It's open, and opening it pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the failed first attempt) and these follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 is failing.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production: its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was already failing health checks in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}